sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CI Pipeline
    participant CLI as llmdbenchmark CLI
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Harness as Harness StatefulSet<br/>8080/TCP
    participant LLM as LLM Inference Endpoint<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant GCS as Google Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prism as Prism Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,CLI: Plan Phase
        User->>CLI: llmdbenchmark plan --spec X --scenario Y
        CLI->>CLI: RenderPlans: merge defaults → spec → scenario → overrides
        CLI->>HF: Verify model access (Bearer Token)
        HF-->>CLI: Model metadata / tokenizer config
        CLI-->>User: Workspace rendered to local filesystem
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over CLI,K8s: Standup Phase
        User->>CLI: llmdbenchmark standup
        CLI->>K8s: Create namespace (Bearer / kubeconfig)
        CLI->>K8s: Apply kustomize manifests (StatefulSet, Service, Route, RBAC)
        K8s-->>CLI: Resources created
        CLI->>K8s: Wait for StatefulSet ready
        K8s-->>CLI: Harness pod running
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over CLI,GCS: Run Phase
        User->>CLI: llmdbenchmark run
        CLI->>K8s: Exec into harness pod (pods/exec)
        K8s->>Harness: Execute benchmark command
        Harness->>LLM: Load generation (inference requests)
        LLM-->>Harness: Inference responses
        Harness->>Harness: Analysis script processes results
        Harness-->>K8s: Benchmark complete
        K8s-->>CLI: Results on PVC
        CLI->>K8s: rsync results from harness (8080/TCP)
        CLI->>GCS: Upload results (Google ADC)
        GCS-->>CLI: Upload confirmed
    end

    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
        Note over CLI,K8s: Teardown Phase
        User->>CLI: llmdbenchmark teardown
        CLI->>K8s: Delete namespace and resources
        K8s-->>CLI: Resources deleted
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over User,K8s: Stack Discovery (separate tool)
        User->>CLI: llm_d_stack_discovery URL
        CLI->>K8s: Query Gateway resources
        CLI->>K8s: Trace HTTPRoute → Service → Pod
        K8s-->>CLI: Stack topology
        CLI-->>User: Structured config snapshot
    end

    Note over Prism: GCS Proxy used as fallback<br/>when direct GCS credentials unavailable
    CLI->>Prism: GET results (no auth)
    Prism-->>CLI: Results data (read-only)
